 Events Welcome Week Student Life Overview Overview Living in Ripon Housing & Dining Living Options Ripon College Dining Clubs & Activities Clubs and Organizations Greek Life ROTC Center for Diversity and Inclusion Esports Campus Services Health and Wellness Parking and Transportation Campus Safety Resources MyRipon Portal Harassment/Title IX Bias Related Incident Protocol Hazing News & Events News News Media Contact Events Events Calendar Plan your event Fine Art Events Arts Events Music Events Theatre Events Ceremonies & Special Events Welcome Week Catalyst Day Commencement Alumni Weekend Family Weekend and Homecoming Publications Publications Athletics Endowed Chairs and Professors Overview Areas of Study Master’s Programs Centers and Resources STEM Faculty Directory Endowed Chairs and Professors Course Catalog Academic Calendar Endowed chairs and professorships are among the highest honors Ripon College can bestow upon its faculty, recognizing exceptional achievement in teaching, research/creative activity, and service. Established through the generosity of donors, these positions provide sustained support that enables distinguished scholars to pursue innovative scholarship, attract top students, and contribute to their fields. Endowed Positions: Helen Swift Neilson Endowed Professorship in the Humanities Est. 1958 Held by Professor Jackie Clark since 2019 Ralph Hale Ruppert and Lenore M. Ruppert Distinguished Professorship in American History, Principles, and Traditions Est. 1976 Held by Professor Becky Matzke since 2019 Victor and Carrie Palmer Endowed Chair for Leadership Values Est. 1980 Held by Professor Jody Roy since 2013 Marie Zarwell Uihlein Chair in Literature, History, Classical Languages, and Culture Est. 1987 Held by Professor Dominique Poncelet since 2021 Barbara Baldwin DeFrees Professorship in the Performing Arts Est. 1987 Held by Professor Erin Bryan since 2026 Harrison E. Farnsworth 1918 Endowed Chair in Physics Est. 1990 Held by Professor Brett Barwick since 2017 Patricia Parker Francis Distinguished Chair in Economics Est. 1991 Held by Professor Soren Hauge since 2020 McCullough 1969 Professorship in Biology Est. 2003 Held by Professor Mark Kainz since 2020 Pieper Servant-Leader Chair Est. 2010 Held by Professor Nick Eastman since 2023 Doreen L. 1973 and David I. Chemerow Chair in Theatre Est. 2012 Held by Professor John Dalziel since 2020 L. Leone Oyster 1919 Chair in Chemistry Est. 2012 Held by Professor Colleen Byron since 2013 Mark J. Franzen ’83 and Janice Heinz Franzen ’83 Professorship in Applied Mathematics Est. 2018 Held by Professor Erin Munro Krull since 2019 Oyster Family Distinguished Professorship in Chemistry Est. 2025 Held by Professor Patrick Willoughby since 2026 DO MORE YOUR WAY Become the extraordinary individual you are meant to be at Ripon. Areas of Study Experiential Learning Center and Resources Quick Links MyRipon Portal Red Hawks Athletics Lane Library Make a Gift Admissions Request Information Visit Apply Resources Campus Map Course Catalog Connect With Us Jobs at Ripon Consumer Information Ripon College 300 W. Seward St. Ripon, WI 54971 P: 920-748-8115 E: [email protected] Copyright © 2026. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy ."
