ome Week Student Life Overview Overview Living in Ripon Housing & Dining Living Options Ripon College Dining Clubs & Activities Clubs and Organizations Greek Life ROTC Center for Diversity and Inclusion Esports Campus Services Health and Wellness Parking and Transportation Campus Safety Resources MyRipon Portal Harassment/Title IX Bias Related Incident Protocol Hazing News & Events News News Media Contact Events Events Calendar Plan your event Fine Art Events Arts Events Music Events Theatre Events Ceremonies & Special Events Welcome Week Catalyst Day Commencement Alumni Weekend Family Weekend and Homecoming Publications Publications Athletics Accepted Students Accepted Students Deposit Now Student Status Register for Orientation Accepted Student Events Welcome Week Extraordinary Starts Here You are brimming with potential and ready to make your mark at Ripon College! And we are here to help you navigate next steps from answering financial aid questions to housing and dining options. Thought this process, if you have any questions, please feel free to reach out to adminfo@ripon.edu . I was originally going to go to a UW school, but once I toured Ripon, I felt at home and that I belonged here. Everyone was so kind and welcoming and made me feel at home. Thirzah Koetz ’26 Exercise Science - Sports Management Housing Review your housing options and submit your application Register for Housing Dining Explore dining options and select your meal plan See Meal Plans Financial Aid Learn about scholarships, payment options and the FAFSA See Options Submit your deposit Become a Red Hawk Today Upcoming Accepted Student Events Oct 10 2026 Fall Preview Day Event Info Oct 10 2026 Fall Preview Day An event for prospective students to learn more about Ripon College and attend the Homecoming festivities afterward. Event Info Dec 5 2026 Celebration of Excellence Event Info The Applicant Portal To submit your enrollment deposit and complete enrollment paperwork, accepted students can login to their Applicant Portal . This portal includes access to forms such as the Housing Form, Health Services Form, Educational Planning Form, and other required next steps. Applicant Portal Summer Orientation New, accepted students and guests will attend a one-day orientation session where students will register for classes with their academic advisor, hear from experts on financial aid, learn about various student services, meet their residence life staff and begin to build community on campus. Connect With Us Make Ripon Yours Learn more about our 40+ student organizations, athletics and more Clubs and Organizations Red Hawk Athletics News and Events INTERESTED IN RIPON? SEE WHAT’S NEXT. Whether you’re ready to apply or want more information, we’ll send you in the right direction. Take the next step toward your extraordinary future today. Schedule a Visit Apply Now Request Info Quick Links MyRipon Portal Red Hawks Athletics Lane Library Make a Gift Admissions Request Information Visit Apply Resources Campus Map Course Catalog Connect With Us Jobs at Ripon Consumer Information Ripon College 300 W. Seward St. Ripon, WI 54971 P: 920-748-8115 E: adminfo@ripon.edu Copyright © 2026. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy . Questions about Ripon College? Get answers in 20 seconds!"
