    "https://ripon.edu/175-celebration/": {
      "title": "175",
      "description": "175 |  Ripon College Skip to Main Content About About Ripon Why Ripon Ripon at a Glance Mission and Vision Strategic Plan Leadership Community Resources Ripon College History Ripon, WI Fact Sheet Support Ripon Support Giving Ways to Give Where to Give Impact of Giving Engage Engage Alumni Events Alumni Weekend R Connections Update Information Parents and Families Volunteer Opportunities Oral Histories Project (PCI) Community Resources Community Resources Willmore Center Ceresco Prairie Conservancy Art Galleries Give to Ripon Show your support for the college and its students with a donation. Give to Ripon Academics Overview Overview Areas of Study Master’s Programs Centers and Resources STEM Faculty Directory Endowed Chairs and Professors Course Catalog Academic Calendar Experiential Learning Experiential Learning SOAR Catalyst Curriculum Career Discovery Tour Center for Politics and the People Ripon College Spain Program in Barcelona MSN Direct Entry Lane Library & Archives Lane Library Library Information Library of Things Collections College Archives Research Guides Student Support Services Faculty Resources Heinz Franzen Learning Center Registrar Registrar Dean’s List Transcripts Four-Year Graduation Guarantee Areas of Study Learn more about our areas of study to decide if Ripon is right for you! Areas of Study Admissions Overview Overview Connect With Us Virtual Map Visit Visit On-Campus Visits Campus Events Fall Preview Day Private Group Visits Apply Apply to Ripon First-Year Applicants Graduate Applicants International Applicants Transfer Applicants Home-schooled Applicants Financial Aid Cost and Financial Aid Affordability The Ripon Commitment Net Price Calculator Apply For Financial Aid Billing Scholarships and Types of Aid Military Benefits Four-Year Graduation Guarantee Your First Year Financial Aid Offer Accepted Students Accepted Students Deposit Now Student Status Register for Orientation Accepted Student Events Welcome Week Student Life Overview Overview Living in Ripon Housing & Dining Living Options Ripon College Dining Clubs & Activities Clubs and Organizations Greek Life ROTC Center for Diversity and Inclusion Esports Campus Services Health and Wellness Parking and Transportation Campus Safety Resources MyRipon Portal Harassment/Title IX Bias Related Incident Protocol Hazing News & Events News News Media Contact Events Events Calendar Plan your event Fine Art Events Arts Events Music Events Theatre Events Ceremonies & Special Events Welcome Week Catalyst Day Commencement Alumni Weekend Family Weekend and Homecoming Publications Publications Athletics 175 Home Explore Support Celebrate Exemplary Past. Extraordinary Future. Celebrating 175 Years of Ripon College Empowering Students since 1851 Ripon has grown from its first class of four women to more than 700 undergraduates enrolled today and hundreds of thousands of alumni in between. While some buildings standing at the first ceremony are still used today, we’ve grown in excellence and tradition ever since. Learn about more about our history below. Brief History of Ripon Our History. Your Future. Proof that small beginnings have big potential. From campus history to impactful firsts, discover our most notable 175 people, including alumni, faculty and staff, who left their mark on Ripon College and its history. Be sure to check back each month as we feature more profiles. See our Profiles The Tradition Continues. Join the Celebration. Join us in our celebration over the next year. Check our calendar for upcoming Ripon events near you. Or, mark your calendar for our biggest Alumni Weekend yet! Sep 30 2026 Milwaukee Fall Rally Hour In celebration of Ripon College’s 175th anniversary year, please join us for Fall Rally Hour in Milwaukee on September 30. All Ripon alumni, parents, and friends all are welcome to join the fun! Wednesday, SEPTEMBER 30 from 5:30-7:30 PM at Third Space Brewery, 1505 W. St Paul Ave, Milwaukee, WI Complimentary appetizers, and cash bar […] Event Info Oct 8 2026 Family Weekend & Homecoming Details TBA! Event questions can be directed to alumni@ripon.edu. Event Info Oct 29 2026 Madison Fall Rally Hour In celebration of Ripon College’s 175th anniversary year, please join us for Fall Rally Hour in Madison on October 29. All Ripon alumni, parents, and friends all are welcome to join the fun! Thursday, OCTOBER 29 from 5:30-7:30 PM at The Vintage Brewing Co. Capitol East, 803 E. Washington Ave., Madison, WI Complimentary appetizers, and […] Event Info Wear the Legacy! As part of our anniversary, we have launched a special “1851” collection. Visit our on-campus apparel store for yours! Merch Store Hours Make A Lasting Impact Help us continue the mission of Ripon College as we prepare the next generation of graduates. Learn about our funding priorities and how you can help. Give Now! Quick Links MyRipon Portal Red Hawks Athletics Lane Library Make a Gift Admissions Request Information Visit Apply Resources Campus Map Course Catalog Connect With Us Jobs at Ripon Consumer Information Ripon College 300 W. Seward St. Ripon, WI 54971 P: 920-748-8115 E: adminfo@ripon.edu Copyright © 2026. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy . Questions about Ripon College? Get answers in 20 seconds!"
    }
